nirguṇaṁ guṇa-bhoktṛ ca\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3689,\"bb\":3252,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/15/b3252/\",\"shadow_value\":\"sarva – of all; indriya – senses; guṇa – of the qualities; ābhāsam – the original source; sarva – all; indriya – senses; vivarjitam – being without; asaktam – without attachment; sarva-bhṛt – the maintainer of everyone; ca – also; eva – certainly; nirguṇam – without material qualities; guṇa-bhoktṛ – master of the guṇas; ca – also.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"sarva\",\"translation\":\"of all\"},{\"word\":\"indriya\",\"translation\":\"senses\"},{\"word\":\"guṇa\",\"translation\":\"of the qualities\"},{\"word\":\"ābhāsam\",\"translation\":\"the original source\"},{\"word\":\"sarva\",\"translation\":\"all\"},{\"word\":\"indriya\",\"translation\":\"senses\"},{\"word\":\"vivarjitam\",\"translation\":\"being without\"},{\"word\":\"asaktam\",\"translation\":\"without attachment\"},{\"word\":\"sarva-bhṛt\",\"translation\":\"the maintainer of everyone\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"nirguṇam\",\"translation\":\"without material qualities\"},{\"word\":\"guṇa-bhoktṛ\",\"translation\":\"master of the guṇas\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3690,\"bb\":3253,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/15/b3253/\",\"body_value\":\"The Supersoul is the original source of all senses, yet He is without senses. He is unattached, although He is the maintainer of all living beings. He transcends the modes of nature, and at the same time He is the master of all the modes of material nature.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",